⚙️ TensorFlow Implementation (Basic Seq2Seq)

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

```python id="s2s_tf"
from tensorflow import keras
from tensorflow.keras import layers

encoder = layers.LSTM(64, return_state=True)
decoder = layers.LSTM(64, return_sequences=True)

# Example structure (simplified)
encoder_outputs, state_h, state_c = encoder(encoder_input)
decoder_outputs = decoder(decoder_input, initial_state=[state_h, state_c])
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔥 PyTorch Implementation (Basic Idea)

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

```python id="s2s_pt"
import torch
import torch.nn as nn

class Encoder(nn.Module):
    def __init__(self):
        super().__init__()
        self.lstm = nn.LSTM(input_size=10, hidden_size=64)

    def forward(self, x):
        outputs, (h, c) = self.lstm(x)
        return h, c
```

