📊 Applications of Seq2Seq

* Machine Translation
* Chatbots
* Text Summarization
* Speech-to-Text
* Question Answering

---

📊 Seq2Seq vs Transformer

| Feature          | Seq2Seq (RNN) | Transformer |
| ---------------- | ------------- | ----------- |
| Speed            | Slow          | Fast        |
| Context handling | Limited       | Strong      |
| Parallelization  | No            | Yes         |
| Performance      | Good          | Best        |

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🧠 Advantages

✔ Handles variable-length sequences
✔ Flexible architecture
✔ Useful for many NLP tasks

---

❌ Limitations

❌ Slow training (RNN-based)
❌ Struggles with long sequences
❌ Requires attention for improvement

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

⚠️ Best Practices

✔ Use attention mechanism
✔ Prefer LSTM/GRU over basic RNN
✔ Use transformers for better performance
✔ Clean and tokenize text properly

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🚀 Workflow

```text id="s2s_flow"
Input Text
   ↓
Tokenization
   ↓
Encoder
   ↓
Context / Attention
   ↓
Decoder
   ↓
Output Sequence
```

